WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.959 --> 00:00:15.682
[Bollywood music playing]

00:00:17.405 --> 00:00:17.892
Cut!

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.185
Okay, everyone
&lt;i&gt;[bell ringing]&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:20.645
that was good.
[applause]

00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:22.564
But we can do 10 percent better.
[applause and cheering]

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:23.564
That was beautiful.
-Okay.

00:00:23.564 --> 00:00:24.564
Very, very good.

00:00:25.737 --> 00:00:26.526
Ahhh!

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:28.611
&lt;i&gt;My friends from college&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;are here.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:30.198 --> 00:00:30.739
Boss!

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:32.449
Perfect timing!

00:00:32.907 --> 00:00:33.908
Welcome to the set of

00:00:37.056 --> 00:00:38.056
I'm playing you!

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:39.414
You like the costume?

00:00:39.414 --> 00:00:40.040
We need to talk.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:40.790
Tell the director

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.333
 I have some notes for him.
-We need to talk to you

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:42.792
in private.

00:00:43.441 --> 00:00:45.378
Oh, Karun, he's worked with me
for 50 years.

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:46.378
I trust him completely.

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:49.424
Actually, when we first met,
he thought I was a vampire.

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:51.009
And he tried to
stake me through the heart.

00:00:51.452 --> 00:00:53.428
I have apologized
so many times.

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:55.263
Not quite enough times.
Very close though.

00:00:55.263 --> 00:00:55.889
I'll let you know.

00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:57.307
Oh, I have to get ready
for the next scene.

00:00:57.348 --> 00:00:58.516
Come to my tent.
We'll talk there.

00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:00.268
You guys are gonna love
the next scene.

00:01:00.268 --> 00:01:00.977
I come in

00:01:01.139 --> 00:01:02.187
on a wire,
'cause you know

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:03.139
&lt;i&gt;I can't fly.&lt;/i&gt;

00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:03.855
&lt;i&gt;Wait.&lt;/i&gt;

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:05.440
&lt;i&gt;Are we getting&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;back together?&lt;/i&gt;

00:01:05.607 --> 00:01:06.274
We need to talk.

00:01:06.691 --> 00:01:07.817
&lt;i&gt;The Deviants are back.&lt;/i&gt;

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.694
We don't know
how many there are.

00:01:12.475 --> 00:01:13.615
You need to come with us.

00:01:14.949 --> 00:01:19.329
 

